<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - U.S. Robotics EPS view up.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - U.S. Robotics EPS view up.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Hambrecht &amp; Quist analyst Rakesh Sood said he reiterated his buy recommendation on modem maker U.S. Robotics Corp and raised his fiscal 1997 estimate to $3.29 a share from $3.23.</p>
<p>-- His revenue estimate for fiscal 1997 remains $3.08 billion.</p>
<p>-- Sood cited continued strength in U.S. Robotic's modem business and the upcoming, faster 56 kilobits-per-second modem upgrade.</p>
<p>-- U.S. Robotics shares were up 3-1/2 at 63.</p>
<p>Reuters Chicago Newsdesk - 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
